@startuml 01b-seq
' 图 01B：端到端运行时间线；结构细节见图 01A，状态门控见图 01C。

skinparam backgroundColor #FCFAF7
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontColor #3E3A39
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 72
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ArrowColor #77716B
skinparam ArrowFontColor #57524E
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #B8AFA6
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F7F3EC
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #77716B
skinparam ParticipantFontColor #3E3A39
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #F7F3EC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B8B0A7

title 图 01B · 从外部任务输入到最终输出：一次可审计的协作运行
caption <color:#6E6963>案例：供应商集成风险评估。读法：虚线回执是 ObservationEntry；绿色分组中的 chg-N 是 Runtime 准入后写入 ChangeLog 的状态转换。</color>

mainframe <b>写入纪律</b> · 外部信号先追加 auditTail；只有 Runtime 可提交 CoordinationChange；正文由 WorkArtifact.contentRef 持有
hide footbox

box "外部边界 · 信号与回执" #F5F1EB
  actor "任务发起人\nHuman" as User #FFFDFC
  boundary "受控工具\nTool" as Tool #FFFDFC
  actor "Reviewer\n人工 / 策略评审" as Reviewer #FFFDFC
end box

box "Cantilune 编排运行时" #E5ECEE
  control "Runtime\n准入 + 提交" as Runtime #F8FBFB
  database "CollaborationStore\nSnapshot + auditTail + ChangeLog" as Store #F8FBFB
  control "ReplayVerifier\n独立重算" as Replay #F8FBFB
end box

box "已注册 Actor" #E5EDE5
  participant "Planner Agent\n分解与委派" as Planner #F9FCF8
  participant "Research Agent\n执行与产出" as Researcher #F9FCF8
end box

== 0 · 输入先留痕：ObservationEntry ≠ CoordinationChange ==

User -> Runtime : 任务请求 · 风险评估
activate Runtime #E5ECEE
Runtime -> Store : append Obs#001
Store --> Runtime : S0′
Runtime -> Runtime : admit introduce
alt 不可准入
  Runtime --> User : 请求补充 / 说明拒绝原因
  note right of Runtime #F3E5DC
    Observation 保留在 auditTail；
    <b>没有 Change 被提交。</b>
  end note
else 准入成功
  Runtime -> Store : chg-001 · introduce
  Store --> Planner : 任务已创建
end
deactivate Runtime

note right of Store #F5F1EB
  <b>同一写入纪律贯穿全程</b>
  commit 前：模板匹配、授权、资源与外部证据核验。
  commit 后：记录 beforeRef / afterRef、targets、initiator 与证据引用。
end note

== 1 · 协调建立：归属、会话与能力显式迁移 ==

Planner -> Runtime : intent · delegate
activate Runtime #E5ECEE
Runtime -> Store : chg-002 · delegate
Store --> Researcher : 会话与写锁已移交
Researcher -> Runtime : intent · accept
Runtime -> Store : chg-003 · accept
deactivate Runtime

== 2 · 受控执行：调用是 Change，回执是 Observation ==

Researcher -> Runtime : intent · invoke_tool
activate Runtime #E5ECEE
Runtime -> Store : chg-004 · invoke_tool
Runtime -> Tool : 受控检索 / 取证
deactivate Runtime

Tool --> Runtime : ExternalSignal · result
activate Runtime #E5ECEE
Runtime -> Store : append Obs#002
Runtime --> Researcher : 证据已留痕
Researcher -> Runtime : intent · attach_evidence
Runtime -> Store : chg-005 · attach_evidence
deactivate Runtime

note right of Store #F5F1EB
  <b>工具回执到达不改协作图。</b>
  只有后续 attach_evidence 被准入后，
  Obs#002 才支撑一次新的 CoordinationChange。
end note

== 3 · 产出与评审：批准 / 修订同样先成为观察 ==

Researcher -> Runtime : intent · submit_artifact
activate Runtime #E5ECEE
Runtime -> Store : chg-006 · submit_artifact
Runtime --> Reviewer : 草稿进入评审
Planner -> Runtime : intent · request_approval
Runtime -> Store : chg-007 · request_approval
deactivate Runtime

Reviewer --> Runtime : ExternalSignal · decision
activate Runtime #E5ECEE
Runtime -> Store : append Obs#003
alt revise
  Runtime --> Researcher : 返回修订范围
  note right of Runtime #F3E5DC
    返工创建新的 Artifact、Snapshot 与 Change；
    <b>不覆盖既有历史。</b>
  end note
else approve
  Runtime -> Runtime : admit publish_artifact
  Runtime -> Store : chg-008 · publish_artifact
end
deactivate Runtime

== 4 · 重放后交付：可追溯必须可验证 ==

Runtime -> Replay : verifyRelease
activate Replay #E5ECEE
Replay -> Store : load chg-001 … chg-008
Replay -> Replay : replay + compare S8
Replay --> Runtime : verification result
deactivate Replay

alt 重放一致 ∧ SuccessCondition(S8)
  Runtime --> User : 交付 final-report + provenance
else 不一致或终态条件不满足
  Runtime -> Store : delivery blocked / escalate
  Runtime --> User : 暂不交付；返回可审计处置状态
end

note over User, Replay #F7F3EC
  <b>工程边界</b>
  · Actor 只发送信号或协调意图；Runtime 是 Change 的唯一提交者。
  · Change 不携带正文 payload；它记录操作、目标、证据与两端快照引用。
  · tracing 可补充运维观测，但 ChangeLog + Replay 才提供可复核的状态转换证据。
end note

footer <color:#6E6963>工程对齐：Cantilune 的 Config / DPOEvent / external observations；任务与产物生命周期参考 A2A；职责归因参考 W3C PROV。</color>
@enduml
